  "borough": "Enfield Council",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development, by reason of its cramped accommodation evidenced by the shortfall of floorspace when compared to London Plan standards for an equivalent number of occupants, and the communal kitchen being undersized and poorly configured for a HMO of this scale, gives rise to a substandard form of accommodation for occupiers, to the detriment of their living conditions. The development is thereby contrary to Section 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3 and D6 of the London Plan (2021), CP 4 and CP 30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), DMD 5, DMD 6 and DMD 8 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014), in addition to the London Housing Design Standards LPG (2023)."
  ],
